      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It’s a devastating realization when you realize you've isolated yourself and now feel utterly alone in the darkness. If reaching out to people feels impossible, perhaps you can start by reaching out to a non-judgmental, anonymous resource. There are trained professionals available via phone or text who can listen without demanding anything from you. You don't have to fix everything at once; just making a small connection can sometimes ease the crushing weight.",
      "source": "target",
